From a1b06188e75447e10ea72a16e408472195480c95 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: daveey <daveey@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 16 Nov 2026 10:33:48 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] [daveey] Bind portable continuation archives to current
 workspace bytes

Require explicit portable-workspace declarations, task/run scoping, exact hub archive digest and full content/type/mode inventory equality before suppressing automatic pins. Recheck local state after the remote read; reject external trees, linked Git metadata and unsupported filesystem entries.

Proof: rejected head reproduces diagnostic, stale, missing-file and external-tree fail-open cases (4 RED). Corrected archive suites: 48 GREEN. Complete inventory includes Git HEAD and dirty bytes; diagnostic-only tarballs cannot grant portability.
